      "designMd": "---\nname: Executive Compliance\ncolors:\n  surface: '#111415'\n  surface-dim: '#111415'\n  surface-bright: '#373a3b'\n  surface-container-lowest: '#0c0f10'\n  surface-container-low: '#191c1d'\n  surface-container: '#1d2021'\n  surface-container-high: '#282a2b'\n  surface-container-highest: '#323536'\n  on-surface: '#e1e3e4'\n  on-surface-variant: '#bacac5'\n  inverse-surface: '#e1e3e4'\n  inverse-on-surface: '#2e3132'\n  outline: '#859490'\n  outline-variant: '#3c4a46'\n  surface-tint: '#3cddc7'\n  primary: '#57f1db'\n  on-primary: '#003731'\n  primary-container: '#2dd4bf'\n  on-primary-container: '#00574d'\n  inverse-primary: '#006b5f'\n  secondary: '#c3c6d4'\n  on-secondary: '#2c303b'\n  secondary-container: '#454955'\n  on-secondary-container: '#b5b8c6'\n  tertiary: '#d3daef'\n  on-tertiary: '#293040'\n  tertiary-container: '#b7bed2'\n  on-tertiary-container: '#464d5e'\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\n  on-error: '#690005'\n  error-container: '#93000a'\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\n  primary-fixed: '#62fae3'\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#3cddc7'\n  on-primary-fixed: '#00201c'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005047'\n  secondary-fixed: '#dfe2f1'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#c3c6d4'\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#171b26'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#434652'\n  tertiary-fixed: '#dce2f7'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#c0c6db'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#141b2b'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#404758'\n  background: '#111415'\n  on-background: '#e1e3e4'\n  surface-variant: '#323536'\ntypography:\n  display:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 48px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 56px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 32px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 40px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  headline-lg-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n  title-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 20px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: '300'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '300'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Inter\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.25rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\n  md: 0.75rem\n  lg: 1rem\n  xl: 1.5rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  base: 8px\n  container-padding-mobile: 16px\n  container-padding-desktop: 32px\n  gutter: 16px\n  stack-sm: 8px\n  stack-md: 16px\n  stack-lg: 24px\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\n\nThis design system is built for a high-stakes SaaS environment where precision and authority are paramount. The brand personality is **vigilant, sophisticated, and dependable**, designed to instill confidence in property managers handling complex legal and safety requirements. \n\nThe visual style follows a **Modern Corporate** direction with a **Minimalist** ethos. It utilizes a deep, dark canvas to reduce eye strain during long periods of data auditing, while using sharp, vibrant accents to draw attention to critical action items. The aesthetic relies on high-quality typography, generous white space (negative space), and subtle depth rather than heavy ornamentation. The emotional response should be one of \"controlled oversight\"—the user feels they have a clear, calm view of their entire portfolio's compliance status.\n\n## Colors\n\nThe palette is anchored by a \"Midnight Navy\" foundation to create a premium, high-contrast environment. \n\n- **Primary:** Electric Teal (#2DD4BF) is reserved exclusively for primary actions, active states, and highlights. It provides a luminous contrast against the dark background.\n- **Surface Tiers:** The background uses #0B0F19 (Deep Navy), while cards and elevated containers use #111827 (Charcoal) to create subtle structural hierarchy.\n- **Typography:** Off-white (#F9FAFB) is used for maximum readability, with reduced opacity variants for secondary metadata.\n- **Functional Colors:** Compliance statuses are strictly mapped to Red (Non-compliant/Overdue), Amber (Expiring soon/Warning), and Green (Compliant/Verified). These should be used with high saturation to stand out against the neutral dark surfaces.\n\n## Typography\n\nThe design system utilizes **Inter** exclusively to ensure a systematic and utilitarian feel. \n\n- **Weight Strategy:** Use `Light (300)` for long-form body text to maintain the premium, airy aesthetic. Use `Semi-Bold (600)` or `Bold (700)` for headlines and data points to create clear visual anchors.\n- **Rhythm:** Line heights are generous (minimum 1.5x for body) to improve legibility on mobile devices.\n- **Capitalization:** Use All-Caps with `Label-sm` for section headers or small metadata badges to differentiate them from interactive labels.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nThis design system uses a **Fluid Grid** with a strict 8px spacing scale. \n\n- **Mobile:** A 4-column layout with 16px side margins and 16px gutters. Navigation is handled via a persistent bottom tab bar.\n- **Desktop:** A 12-column layout with a maximum content width of 1440px. Gutters expand to 24px for a more spacious, \"executive\" feel.\n- **Density:** High whitespace is preferred. Vertical stacks should default to 24px (stack-lg) between distinct logical sections and 8px (stack-sm) between related labels and inputs.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nHierarchy is established through **Tonal Layering** and **Subtle Outlines** rather than aggressive shadows. \n\n- **Surface 0 (Background):** #0B0F19.\n- **Surface 1 (Cards/Modals):** #111827. These elements receive a 1px solid border of #1F2937 (a slightly lighter charcoal) to define their edges against the background.\n- **Shadows:** Use a single, soft ambient shadow for floating elements (like FABs or dropdowns). Shadow color should be pure black (#000000) at 30% opacity with a 20px blur and 4px offset.\n- **Interactive States:** When a card is hovered or pressed, the border color shifts to the primary Electric Teal at 30% opacity.\n\n## Shapes\n\nThe design system employs **Rounded** geometry to soften the technical nature of compliance data. \n\n- **Standard Containers:** Use a 12px radius (`rounded-lg`) for cards, input fields, and modals.\n- **Large Surfaces:** Dashboard \"hero\" sections or large layout containers use a 16px radius (`rounded-xl`).\n- **Interactive Elements:** Buttons and Status Badges use a full \"Pill\" radius for high touch-affordance and visual distinction from content containers.\n\n## Components\n\n- **Buttons:** Primary buttons are Solid Electric Teal with dark navy text. Secondary buttons use a ghost style (Teal border, no fill). All buttons have a minimum height of 48px for mobile accessibility.\n- **Status Badges:** Subtle background tints (10% opacity of the status color) with high-contrast text and a small 6px leading dot for quick scanning.\n- **Cards:** Cards should be border-only or subtly filled. They must include a clear header and 16px-24px internal padding.\n- **Input Fields:** Darker than the card surface (#030712), with a 1px border. The label sits above the field in `Label-md`. Active state is indicated by a Primary Teal border.\n- **Bottom Tab Bar:** Semi-transparent background with a heavy backdrop blur (20px). Active icons are Primary Teal; inactive icons are mid-grey.\n- **Empty States:** Use monochromatic, line-art illustrations centered in the viewport with a \"primary\" CTA button directly below the message.\n- **Loading:** Use Skeleton pulses with a gradient moving from #111827 to #1F2937.",
